  "markdown_content": "## Investment Announcement\\n\\nTaiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company (TSMC), the world's largest contract chipmaker, has revealed ambitious plans to significantly expand its presence in the United States with a massive $165 billion investment initiative.\\n\\nThe investment will focus on building advanced semiconductor manufacturing facilities to meet growing demand for AI-related chips and strengthen the global semiconductor supply chain.\\n\\n## Strategic Impact\\n\\nThis strategic move represents one of the largest foreign investments in US manufacturing history and demonstrates TSMC's commitment to expanding its global footprint beyond Taiwan.\\n\\nThe company aims to develop cutting-edge fabrication plants that will produce advanced chips essential for:\\n\\n* Artificial intelligence\\n* Machine learning\\n* High-performance computing applications",
